    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool must provide quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, support drafting professional documents, handle client files, and facilitate collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what is the proposed AI design for an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on The client requirements, I propose an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that leverages our company's Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The RAG approach will enable an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool to provide quick access to reliable and up-to-date information by retrieving relevant passages from a curated corpus of regulatory and methodological reference materials. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool will be designed as a non-decisional support tool, strictly assisting professionals in professionals daily activities without making decisions on professionals behalf. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool will support drafting professional documents such as client letters, mission notes, and file syntheses through template-guided drafting capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool will handle client files by providing retrieval of regulatory and methodological information assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate collaboration and mission continuity, an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool will be designed to enable relevant information sharing, understanding of the context of an in-progress client file, and efficient resumption by another collaborator. our company's fine-tuning methods can be employed to adapt the model to The client specific needs and corpus of reference materials. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool will also incorporate our company's explainability tools, which provide features such as source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and logging of every interaction for a posteriori audit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures transparency, reliability, and trust in the AI-driven outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Performance benchmarks from our company's past use cases indicate that The RAG approach can achieve high accuracy and efficiency in information retrieval and document drafting tasks. our company's solution will be designed to meet The client performance expectations while ensuring the preservation of professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of trade-offs, our company's acknowledge that our company's sovereign European open-weight model may have somewhat lower raw performance on complex tasks compared to top-tier proprietary models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, this choice is necessary to ensure data sovereignty, explainability, and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of missions between collaborators by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress client file, and an efficient resumption by another collaborator.  4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, the proposed AI design for this solution-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity, preserves professional secrecy, and remains strictly a non-decisional support tool will leverage our company's RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, and explainability tools to provide a reliable, efficient, and non-decisional support tool that meets the client's requirements and preserves professional secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what are the necessary measures to ensure the solution sustainability and minimize the solution environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To limit the environmental footprint of the solution and rely on low-carbon infrastructure, our company's can leverage our company's existing capabilities. our company's, has a Silver EcoVadis rating, indicating a strong commitment to sustainability. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone and have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, covering scopes 1, 2, and main scope 3 items, including cloud inference. our company's can utilize our company's green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU region, renewable energy, and a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, as well as heat reuse." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This alignment with low-carbon infrastructure will help minimize the solution carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which reduces energy consumption and supports our company's goal of minimizing environmental impact. our company's inference efficiency also serves as an energy lever, further contributing to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a responsible tech charter signatory with gender balance and inclusion objectives, an apprenticeship and work-study program, and a research partnership with the Grenoble research ecosystem, our company's are committed to social and environmental responsibility. our company's AI ethics principles, including human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and a documented data-use policy, ensure that our company's solutions are not only sustainable but also ethical and responsible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding known sustainability trade-offs, our company's acknowledge the tension between our company's premium tier's energy intensity and our premium tier's associated footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the tension between our premium tier's energy intensity and its associated footprint, our company's will present our premium tier's with our premium tier's explicit footprint, allowing clients to make informed decisions about clients environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these existing capabilities and commitments, our company's can ensure that our company's solution is designed and deployed with sustainability in mind, minimizing our solution environmental footprint while meeting the client's requirements for low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory, professional and legal constraints  4.1 Professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
